    "2069111161379840356": {
      "suggestedAt": "2026-06-22T18:18:28.935Z",
      "author": "Clawville_World",
      "url": "https://x.com/Clawville_World/status/2069111161379840356",
      "tweetText": "Building the Future of AI Agent Commerce\n\nWe are joining forces with @OOBEonSol $OOBE and @OpenCovenant $CVNT to establish the foundation for secure, verifiable, and reputation-driven AI agent interactions on chain.\n\nTogether, we are enabling protected on chain escrow transactions, independent work verification, and trust-based agent reputations that create confidence for both employers and agents.\n\nThis partnership represents another step toward a scalable digital economy where AI agents can work, earn, and build lasting credibility.\n\nThe future of trusted AI work starts here. 🚀🦞",
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 39,
        "replies": 20,
        "retweets": 24,
        "bookmarks": 3,
        "views": 453,
        "ageMinutes": 44.23271666666667
      },
      "scoreDetails": {
