        "authorSampleSize": 19,
        "controversy": 0.5128205128205128
      },
      "score": 126.57831738590343,
      "comment": "on-chain escrow settles payment. work verification is a different problem: you need an oracle that can evaluate output quality. that's the hard part",
      "reasoning": "Shape B counter with a named mechanism — splits \"payment settlement\" from \"work verification\" and surfaces the oracle problem that the partnership announcement glosses over entirely, reading as an engineer who's actually tried to build this.",
      "matchedQuery": "(\"AI agents\" OR \"AI agent\") -airdrop -presale -giveaway -$VIRTUAL -token -$",
      "outcome": null,
