      "url": "https://x.com/ritualfnd/status/2069454654275260721",
      "tweetText": "Ritual Chain public testnet is live.\n\nIt's a chain built specifically for AI agents — on-chain inference, composable precompiles, native scheduling. Not \"AI-adjacent.\" Actually AI-native.\n\nHere's what that means if you're building 👇🏻",
